      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This needs to blow up more. I'm using a PS4 Headset and Controller for my PC. Using Steam VR and IVRY Driver thingy. I go to VRChat and I can move around ect, but I can't interact with objects, Avatars, menus ect. Like OP said there's no Head Tracker Cursor (At least for me). However I've watched an old Video from 2018 where a guy is using almost the same set up as me (Using an Xbox controller and a different Driver called Trinus VR) and has a Head Tracker Cursor. Idk if it's something I have to search for in the options, but I can't even do that since when I go to PC mode and change the options they don't stay in VR Mode.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
